---
title: AWS Production Architecture — Proposed, Not Deployed
---
flowchart TB
  Mobile["React Native / Expo customer app<br/>SQLite outbox + saved server reads"]
  Cognito["Cognito<br/>Customer JWT"]
  Employee["Employee / adjuster tools<br/>Entra ID + corporate access"]
  Edge["CloudFront + WAF<br/>Abuse protection; no shared PII cache"]
  GW["API Gateway HTTP API<br/>JWT + throttles"]
  Internal["Internal employee API boundary<br/>Separate audience, role / assignment checks"]
  subgraph Primary["us-east-1 • proposed primary region"]
    subgraph VPC["Private VPC • application/data tiers across two AZs"]
      Entry["VPC link + internal ALB<br/>Explicit TLS + healthy target routing"]
      subgraph A["Availability Zone A"]
        API["Fargate API tasks<br/>Intake / evidence metadata / status reads"]
        DB[("RDS PostgreSQL primary<br/>Claims + evidence + transactional outbox")]
      end
      subgraph B["Availability Zone B"]
        ReplicaTasks["Fargate API / worker replicas<br/>Same service responsibilities"]
        Standby[("RDS Multi-AZ standby")]
      end
      Proxy["RDS Proxy<br/>Bounded database connections"]
      Workers["Fargate workers across AZ A + B<br/>Outbox publisher / delivery / reconciliation<br/>Persist outcomes and timeline in RDS"]
      Hybrid["VPN / Direct Connect<br/>Controlled cloud-to-enterprise boundary"]
    end
    Storage[("Private S3 • regional service<br/>Direct PUT; KMS / versions / quarantine")]
    Queue[["SQS standard + DLQ • regional service<br/>At-least-once; backoff / reviewed redrive"]]
    Scan["Malware scan + clean-only access gate<br/>Receipt is not scan clearance"]
    Ops["Operations • Entra / IAM<br/>CloudWatch + ADOT / X-Ray<br/>KMS + Secrets Manager + audit"]
  end
  subgraph Prem["On-premises • existing authoritative systems"]
    Policies["Policy system<br/>Coverage / eligibility"]
    Legacy["Claims system<br/>Adjudication; durable reference dedupe required"]
  end
  subgraph DR["us-west-2 • proposed pilot-light recovery region"]
    DRDB[("Asynchronous RDS read replica")]
    DRS3[("S3 replicated object versions")]
    Recovery["Fence primary; manually promote; verify evidence<br/>Reconstruct regional queue; resolve ambiguous sends<br/>Canary then switch traffic and resume"]
  end
  Cognito -.->|"authenticate"| Mobile
  Mobile -->|"HTTPS + customer JWT"| Edge
  Edge --> GW --> Entry
  Employee --> Internal --> Entry
  Entry --> API
  Entry --> ReplicaTasks
  API --> Proxy --> DB
  DB ==>|"synchronous Multi-AZ replication"| Standby
  Mobile -->|"presigned PUT; bytes bypass API"| Storage
  API -->|"presign / receipt check"| Storage
  Storage ==>|"object events"| Scan
  DB ==>|"eligible outbox via publisher"| Queue
  Queue ==>|"bounded consumers"| Workers
  Workers -->|"create / status lookup"| Hybrid
  API -->|"policy integration"| Hybrid
  Hybrid --> Policies
  Hybrid --> Legacy
  Ops -.->|"telemetry / controls"| Workers
  Ops -.->|"logs / tracing / keys / secrets"| API
  DB ==>|"async replication; lag can exceed target"| DRDB
  Storage ==>|"async cross-region replication"| DRS3
  DRDB -.-> Recovery
  DRS3 -.-> Recovery
  Legend["Legend: thin = synchronous request / transfer<br/>thick = asynchronous transport / replication<br/>dotted = identity / operations / recovery administration"]
